  What begins as a simple investigation will soon draw you into a web of familial rivalries, forbidden arcane practices, and the terrible bargain made generations ago that doomed Shadowfen to its current fate.

  #dnd-note[
    = The Mark of the Taken

    Those who have come in contact with the entity that haunts Shadowfen bear an invisible mark that can only be seen in reflections. A successful DC 15 Wisdom (Perception) check while looking at someone's reflection reveals whether they bear this mark. Those who are marked will be the next to vanish when the moons align, unless the mark is cleansed through a ritual requiring rare ingredients from the surrounding swamplands.
  ]

